WEBVTT

1.1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.235
Step 1. Open the questionnaire.

1.2
00:00:02.235 --> 00:00:07.484
Sharing it with departments lets their members see it and select it when they fill

1.3
00:00:07.484 --> 00:00:08.701
in a questionnaire.

1.4
00:00:08.701 --> 00:00:13.810
In Settings, under Forms, select Questionnaires, then the questionnaire.

2.1
00:00:13.810 --> 00:00:16.493
Step 2. Open the department picker.

2.2
00:00:16.493 --> 00:00:21.220
In the Questionnaire Properties panel, find the Organizations field,

2.3
00:00:21.220 --> 00:00:26.795
and select Select Department. Care lists the departments of the facility.

3.1
00:00:26.795 --> 00:00:29.273
Step 3. Select the departments.

3.2
00:00:29.273 --> 00:00:34.015
Search for a department, or expand one to see its sub-departments,

3.3
00:00:34.015 --> 00:00:40.192
and select its check box. Select Done, and Care lists the selected departments.

4.1
00:00:40.192 --> 00:00:42.439
Step 4. Remove a department.

4.2
00:00:42.439 --> 00:00:47.146
Do this only when a department must stop seeing the questionnaire.

4.3
00:00:47.146 --> 00:00:50.713
Select the X button next to the department.

5.1
00:00:50.713 --> 00:00:54.554
Step 5. Save your changes. Select Save Questionnaire.

5.2
00:00:54.554 --> 00:00:58.484
Care saves the department changes only when you select it.

5.3
00:00:58.484 --> 00:01:03.862
The version number stays the same, because the questions did not change.
